Linux 7.2 renamed the atomic update container from drm_atomic_state to
drm_atomic_commit.  Port the CIX callbacks and stored update objects to the
new API directly, without a compatibility alias, and retain the warning and
kernel-doc corrections needed for clean GCC and Clang W=1 builds.


